    },
    "body": "## Summary\n- Preserve native Divine loop counts from Funnelcake instead of discarding them as non-archive data.\n- Display loop totals as the primary visible count in feed cards, video detail, and fullscreen, falling back to view starts only when loops are absent.\n- Keep source reconstruction from writing native playback loops as archived Vine `loops` tags.\n\n## Motivation\nNative videos were showing view-start counts where the UI expects loop counts. For videos with real loop telemetry, that made the visible count look implausibly tied to engagement.\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] npm run test\n\n## Visual Change\n- No screenshot attached; this is a metric source/label behavior fix with the same UI layout.",
